      "rendered": "<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3141\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/01/29/ceiling-gypsum-001/material_ceiling_012/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/material_ceiling_012.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"material_ceiling_012\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/material_ceiling_012.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3141\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/material_ceiling_012.png?resize=600%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Material_Ceiling_012.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3141\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/01/29/ceiling-gypsum-001/material_ceiling_012/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/material_ceiling_012.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"material_ceiling_012\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/material_ceiling_012.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3141 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20600%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"Material_Ceiling_012.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/material_ceiling_012.png\"></p>\n<h2>Ceiling Gypsum 001 – Free seamless texture, 1024&nbsp;x 1024, with the following maps:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Roughness</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n<li>Metallic</li>\n<li>Emissive Mask</li>\n<li>Objects Mask</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<blockquote><p><strong>For Tier 3 Patrons, there&#8217;s a 4K resolution uncompressed PNG version of this texture. There&#8217;s also a SBS and a SBSAR files for texture customization.</strong></p></blockquote>\n<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3142\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/01/29/ceiling-gypsum-001/ceiling_gypsum_001/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/ceiling_gypsum_001.gif?fit=942%2C776&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"942,776\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"ceiling_gypsum_001\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/ceiling_gypsum_001.gif?fit=800%2C659&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3142\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/ceiling_gypsum_001.gif?resize=800%2C659&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Ceiling_Gypsum_001.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"659\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3142\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/01/29/ceiling-gypsum-001/ceiling_gypsum_001/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/ceiling_gypsum_001.gif?fit=942%2C776&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"942,776\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"ceiling_gypsum_001\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/ceiling_gypsum_001.gif?fit=800%2C659&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3142 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20942%20776%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"Ceiling_Gypsum_001.gif\" width=\"942\" height=\"776\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/ceiling_gypsum_001.gif\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1ttazpTKX7DILlXAuIfR5zCrFnPhdHrOb\" target=\"_blank\" r